        356.2579345703125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "tion at the terminal states of sampled trajectories. We first",
      "bbox": [
        48.964012145996094,
        359.1873779296875,
        300.0216369628906,
        368.09393310546875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "evaluated image prediction through geometric projection of",
