        48.964012145996094,
        394.6943664550781,
        254.4227294921875,
        403.6009216308594
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "First, the depth image was projected into 3D space, then",
      "bbox": [
        58.9270133972168,
        406.7693786621094,
        300.0219421386719,
        415.6759338378906
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "assigned to pixels in the camera view at the future state. We",
      "bbox": [
        48.964012145996094,
        418.6053771972656,
        300.0215759277344,
        427.5119323730469
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "evaluated both nearest pixel assignment and bilinear splatting.",
      "bbox": [
        48.964012145996094,
        430.4413757324219,
        300.0214538574219,
        439.3479309082031
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "We found that this approach did not yield consistently accurate",
      "bbox": [
        48.964012145996094,
        442.2763671875,
        300.021484375,
        451.18292236328125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "predictions and often left many pixels unassigned, making it",
      "bbox": [
        48.964012145996094,
        454.11236572265625,
        300.021484375,
        463.0189208984375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "unsuitable for evaluating the actor and critic at future states",
      "bbox": [
        48.964012145996094,
        465.9483642578125,
